ypical infection patterns", "Inflammatory bowel disease: Abdominal pain + weight loss but no localized signs on exam", "Leukemoid reaction: High WBC count but differential remains normal (suggests non-malignant etiology)", "Thyrotoxicosis: Systolic murmur in left upper sternal border but lacks tachycardia/heat intolerance triad", "Myeloid neoplasm: Elevated LAP and hypercalcemia suggest this but posterior remains <0.85"], "alarm_features": ["Extreme leukocytosis (66,500/mm³)", "Mild fever (37.5°C)", "Elevated serum calcium (10.9 mEq/L)"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Reactive / Non-malignant Leukocytosis", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.1487431293514108, "posterior": 0.1487431293514108, "danger": 0.3, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.4, "interrupt_relevance": 0.1, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Myeloid Neoplasm (including Chronic MPN and Blast-bearing Phases)", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.5992964455844634, "posterior": 0.5992964455844634, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.65, "interrupt_relevance": 0.8, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["acute myeloid leukemia", "myelodysplastic syndrome with excess blasts", "chronic myeloid leukemia in blast crisis"]}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Lymphoid Neoplasm", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.04116379626236718, "posterior": 0.04116379626236718, "danger": 0.7, "acti